<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coastcast Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coastcast Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities Analyst John Weiss raised his rating on Coastcast Corp from HOLD to BUY Friday.</p>
<p>-- Weiss expects the company to earn $1.97 per share in Fiscal Year (December) 1996 and $2.35 per share in Fiscal Year 1997.</p>
<p>--Weiss said he views Coastcast as very undervalued with the stock selling at only 6.6X his 1997 EPS estimate and has therefore raised his rating.</p>
<p>Coastcast is a leading manufacturer of investment-cast golf clubheads and acts as principal supplier to many of the largest producers of high-quality, premium-priced metal woods, irons and putters.</p>
</text>
